# BMad planning artifacts are versioned. Keep them free of client-attributed
# employment detail and non-public employer names; binaries carrying such
# material stay outside the repository (~/.echowaves-local-imports).

# bmad: per-run rendered workflow copies, regenerated on demand
_bmad/render/

# Private by construction. These two record what the history rewrites removed — the
# support ticket and this initiative's memory — so they stay local, not published.
_bmad-output/echowaves-site/ux-site-redesign/github-purge-request.md
_bmad-output/echowaves-site/ux-site-redesign/github-purge-request.txt
_bmad-output/echowaves-site/ux-site-redesign/.memlog.md

# The scrub rules are the client names themselves; they live in ~/.echowaves-local-imports
scrub-rules.json
